1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,346
Hello Priya, I am Ravi speaking from the school office.

2
00:00:05,346 --> 00:00:12,149
I am calling to inquire about the science trip for class 9 next month.

3
00:00:12,149 --> 00:00:18,272
The bus will leave from the school gate on the 14th at 7:30 AM.

4
00:00:18,272 --> 00:00:25,950
Please ask every student to bring a packed lunch, water bottle, and a notebook.

5
00:00:25,950 --> 00:00:32,617
We will first visit the planetarium and the show will start at ten o'clock, after

6
00:00:32,617 --> 00:00:39,448
which we will go to the botanical garden where a guide will explain how plants make

7
00:00:39,448 --> 00:00:40,354
their food.

8
00:00:40,354 --> 00:00:44,222
Lunch will be around one o'clock in the garden.

9
00:00:44,222 --> 00:00:50,972
The fee is three hundred and fifty rupees per student and includes bus tickets and

10
00:00:50,972 --> 00:00:51,630
a guide.

11
00:00:51,630 --> 00:00:57,120
Please collect the money and signed permission slips by Friday.

12
00:00:57,120 --> 00:01:03,744
So far, forty-two students have registered, and we have room for fifty more.

13
00:01:03,744 --> 00:01:10,541
If any student needs help with the fees, please let me know privately, and the

14
00:01:10,541 --> 00:01:12,981
school will take care of it.

15
00:01:12,981 --> 00:01:16,380
Two parents have offered to come along.

16
00:01:16,380 --> 00:01:19,565
But we still need another teacher.

17
00:01:19,565 --> 00:01:21,158
Could you ask Mr.

18
00:01:21,158 --> 00:01:24,437
Sharma if he is available that day?

19
00:01:24,437 --> 00:01:29,215
We should be back to school by 5 PM in the evening.

20
00:01:29,215 --> 00:01:34,274
Parents can pick up their children from the main gate.

21
00:01:34,274 --> 00:01:41,300
I will send the complete plan on the class group by Wednesday, if it rains.

22
00:01:41,300 --> 00:01:47,296
Instead of a picnic, there will be a visit to the science museum.

23
00:01:47,296 --> 00:01:53,845
The museum has a new section on space, so students will still enjoy it.

24
00:01:53,845 --> 00:02:01,133
Please remind students to wear their school ID cards; students who forget their

25
00:02:01,133 --> 00:02:07,313
identification card will not be allowed entry into the planetarium.

26
00:02:07,313 --> 00:02:08,420
Furthermore,

27
00:02:08,420 --> 00:02:15,690
No one should bring a mobile phone for emergency situations; we will have teachers'

28
00:02:15,690 --> 00:02:16,303
phones.

29
00:02:16,303 --> 00:02:22,260
The emergency contact number for travel is the school office number.

30
00:02:22,260 --> 00:02:29,355
Another thing is that three students are allergic to food, and their parents have

31
00:02:29,355 --> 00:02:30,318
sent notes.

32
00:02:30,318 --> 00:02:34,260
I will give you those notes tomorrow morning.

33
00:02:34,260 --> 00:02:41,170
thank you for helping with this and call me back if you have any questions
